{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21031","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21031-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21031-0","text":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21031-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21031-1","text":"虽然在姐姐身边，她却什么都听不见。\n只有心底的声音越来越响。\n\n「姐姐的身体冷冷的。」\n「姐姐的身体不会动。」\n\n愤怒的潮水将她淹没，义无反顾。她已来不及想起——\n\n「姐姐的身体，很早以前就是冷的了。」","speaker":""}]}
